// Touch-ally AC buff ("+2 AC ward"), delivered as a `ProtectingWard`
// `BasicAura` at the sheet's own 18 m cast range -- the same touch-ally
// aura shape shield_of_faith's sibling ally-wards in this file already use.
// Strength kept below shield.ron's own single-hit spike (0.35) and
// resistance.ron's (0.15 too, but shorter-lived): this is a mild, lasting
// concentration buff rather than either of those.
//
// `duration: Some(60.0)` matches the sheet's own `Concentration(60)` field,
// not D&D canon's 10-minute (600s) version -- same intentional
// already-shortened-at-the-sheet-level duration as
// protection_from_evil_and_good.ron, not a truncation introduced here.
BasicAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.3,
    cast_duration: 0.15,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    targets: InGroup,
    auras: [
        (
            kind: ProtectingWard,
            strength: 0.15,
            duration: Some(60.0),
            category: Some(Magical),
        ),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(60.0),
    range: 18.0,
    energy_cost: 25.0,
    scales_with_combo: false,
    specifier: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Divine)),
)
